<PageLayout title='Homogmos AI' kicker='PROJECT // EXPERIMENTAL' lead='Language models as interfaces for scientific knowledge—not substitutes for scientific judgment.'>
<section><div class="prose content-page"><p>This project explores how local and hosted language models can support biological research, education and public science interfaces.</p><p>Prior experiments have included local FastAPI/Ollama backends and conversational prototypes. The current direction is broader: connect models to explicit scientific resources, structured datasets and reproducible tools rather than relying on unconstrained conversation alone.</p><h2>$ principles</h2><ul><li>Use AI as an interface, not an oracle</li><li>Keep provenance and uncertainty visible</li><li>Prefer tools that connect to real scientific data</li><li>Design for human review and correction</li></ul></div></section>
</PageLayout>